Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.67,0:00:21.76,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My body feels so light!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.61,0:00:28.88,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Just when I thought I had survived!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:30.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How long am I going to let \Nmyself be intimidated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.13,0:00:33.93,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.39,0:00:41.73,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Did increasing my strength ability \Nmake that much of a difference?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.92,0:00:46.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But this thing's still stronger than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:51.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No! My attacks aren't working!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.59,0:01:01.50,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:43.73,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't do this on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,With no party, no healer...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:51.33,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,My bag's only got water and food in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:54.54,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:58.28,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If only I had a weapon with magic power!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:02:59.53,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.84,0:03:00.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Inventory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.72,0:03:19.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't know how this got in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.16,0:03:24.23,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think Kim said he paid three million for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:26.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The kind of item I could never afford.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:30.56,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Well, this is an emergency. \NI'll put it to good use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:33.28,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Huh? The pain's fading.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.37,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Now that I have a weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.39,0:03:39.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:44.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Huh? It's stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.08,0:03:48.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Come on! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.39,0:04:00.74,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,They don't call them steel-fanged \Nfor nothing, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.80,0:04:03.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I just got this sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:07.16,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Chew on something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.73,0:04:14.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've gotta admit...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.17,0:04:16.71,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Compared to what I ran into before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,these guys aren't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.02,0:04:38.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm level 2 now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.95,0:04:41.51,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That never changed during my daily quests.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Oh, I know. It's because this is real combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.90,0:04:46.95,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And my injuries healing from before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:51.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess all my stats go up \Nby one when I level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:53.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's five points in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:58.75,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Daily quests only net me three points, \Nso fighting seems more efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:03.15,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder how much a difference \Nof one point makes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.15,0:05:05.85,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There are values for intelligence, \Nperception, and such, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.73,0:05:08.80,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But strength is the obvious one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:12.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm only at 32 there, but my body \Nalready feels a lot lighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.74,0:05:17.90,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm speculating here, but I think that \Nthe higher my base abilities grow,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.90,0:05:20.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,the more points I'll gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:25.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I really can get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.30,0:05:32.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm overreacting, considering \Nthat it was just five small beasts...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:37.98,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder if they have any essence stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.61,0:05:43.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I get items instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.57,0:05:46.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,These weird things happening to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:50.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If they follow the same kind \Nof logic that a game does,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:55.52,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,then this dungeon and the magic beasts in it \Nare different from what's inside the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.44,0:05:58.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's a store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:00.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.37,0:06:04.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess beginners get locked out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.68,0:06:05.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.38,0:06:11.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Twenty gold?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.59,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I wonder how much money that's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:19.30,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Then again, this seems like \Nan E-Rank dungeon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.30,0:06:22.08,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,so twenty gold can't be worth that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Okay, so what do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.65,0:06:29.19,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can't leave until I beat the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.51,0:06:34.48,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A teleportation stone will let me get out, \Nbut I don't know where to find those.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.87,0:06:37.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I stay too long, I'll run out of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.33,0:06:45.25,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,E-Rank or not, I don't think \NI can beat a boss on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.87,0:06:49.22,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Wait... Maybe if I level up enough first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:55.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Granted, I might die before I manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.18,0:07:12.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be afraid. \NI already know what dying is like!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.51,0:07:34.89,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna go down easy. \NAnd I don't expect you guys to, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:41.35,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'd feel guilty if I killed you too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.02,0:07:45.33,Flashback,Associate D,0,0,0,,You qualify to become a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:49.11,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Now I can afford Mom's treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.35,0:07:51.64,FlashbackItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I had one more chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.34,0:07:58.03,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Let's fight... Let's make it intense!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,For as long as we're alive... \NAs hard as we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:10.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If I can get stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll gladly follow these ridiculous rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.15,Default,Passerby A,0,0,0,,That can't be good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.52,0:08:27.84,Default,Passerby B,0,0,0,,I wish the Association would \Ndo something already.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Sword's not gonna last much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.01,0:08:45.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,At the end of the day, \Nweapons are disposable, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.26,0:08:50.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even the expensive ones still end up \Nlike this after a few dungeon runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.93,0:08:51.63,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.05,0:08:54.42,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This might be a good stopping point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:02.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I got 34 wolf fangs,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:05.68,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,two worn daggers, a traveler's cloak...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.43,0:09:11.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and, surprisingly, a teleportation stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.42,0:09:14.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe I should leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:20.69,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But I might never get the chance \Nto get stronger this easily ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:24.49,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't know what'll happen to this dungeon \Nwhen I use the teleportation stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:25.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Will it vanish?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.56,0:09:31.63,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe it'll disappear without a trace, \Nlike a limited-time event in a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.47,0:09:36.87,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I seem to be wrapped up \Nin something I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:40.81,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It's like I'm dancing atop the Buddha's palm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:46.70,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Do I move forward, or head back?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.39,0:10:04.24,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Lee Joohee...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.80,0:10:09.94,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,From the Hunter's Association? \NI apologize about the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.44,0:10:15.30,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,There was a dungeon break at the gate?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.30,0:10:16.99,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,That's nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.76,DefaultItalics,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,If I hadn't turned down that offer...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:24.04,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,We've been assembling free \Nhunters to deal with it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:26.90,DefaultItalics,Associate A,0,0,0,,there's such a shortage of healers...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.06,0:10:33.44,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.86,DefaultItalicsTop,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The higher my level rose,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:41.22,DefaultItalicsTop,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,the easier it became \Nto defeat the magic beasts.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.74,0:10:51.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The color of the text \Ndescribing them has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:57.28,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I think white means they're relatively weak.\NOrange means they're on equal footing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.94,0:10:59.89,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And red means they're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.43,0:11:04.85,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The Lycans that were red \Nat first are white now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:07.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I've become that much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:13.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But even at my current level, l don't feel \Nlike I can take the one that's down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.10,0:11:16.99,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe it's thanks to my perception \Nability being that much higher,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.99,0:11:18.78,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.65,0:11:23.43,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's a monster down there... \Nand it gives me goosebumps.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.95,0:11:28.46,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I don't think I can gain \Nany more levels around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:31.92,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And if I fight needlessly, \Nthe sword won't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:48.23,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Was the stairway in this \Nstation always this long?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.65,0:12:04.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,It doesn't look anything \Nlike the station I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.48,0:12:12.43,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.30,0:12:28.62,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Even after all that leveling up, \Nits name is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,orange?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.11,0:12:35.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You must be the boss around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:39.45,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,There's no way this sword could \Npenetrate those armored scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.77,0:12:42.05,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,And fighting empty-handed \Nis out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.16,0:12:54.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Between this speed and the way it \Nthrows its weight into each attack...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:57.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'll have to find a way around its defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.64,0:13:00.66,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,But what do I do against \Narmor as thick as this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:11.27,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If it lands a clean hit on me, I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.54,0:13:34.40,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I thought I'd gotten a bit stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:46.64,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Is it still not enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.86,0:13:51.11,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,How much stronger do I need to get...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.77,0:13:55.90,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,before it makes up for a life \Nspent being a laughing stock?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.24,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,"The Weakest Hunter of All Mankind"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.80,0:14:05.75,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,I hear that's what they've been calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.14,0:14:06.98,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.98,0:14:10.76,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable how childish \Nsome people can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:14.63,Flashback,Song Chiyul,0,0,0,,Work hard to prove them wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.86,0:14:19.43,Flashback,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Right. I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.88,0:14:39.76,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I got called that because I'm weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.45,0:14:42.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I get mocked because I'm weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:47.65,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I'm ashamed of myself, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.08,0:14:50.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If you're strong—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.21,0:14:56.00,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If you have overwhelming strength, you go \Ninto every situation with an advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:59.01,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,When you're powerless, there's nothing \Nyou can do around the strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:02.72,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,besides quiver in fear \Nand stand around helplessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:05.31,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You get looked down on when you're weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.31,0:15:09.83,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,You can be knowledgeable, you can \Nbe creative, you can be considerate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.31,0:15:12.36,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but when faced with the strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.24,0:15:15.44,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,none of it will save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:19.17,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Kindness won't save me! \NSo I'll become stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.17,0:15:21.24,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's why I came this far!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.13,0:15:37.05,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.05,0:15:45.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,gotta get stronger!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:52.56,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:57.98,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Compared to that thing... \NCompared to the terror I felt back then...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:00.44,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This will be easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.92,0:16:18.13,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I focused specifically \Non increasing my strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.36,0:16:24.84,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I should be able to...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.63,0:16:30.97,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I know that, here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.35,0:16:35.38,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I can kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.19,0:16:42.04,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.44,0:17:17.37,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I really have gotten a bit stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.01,0:17:29.26,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Got something nice out of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.80,0:17:33.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This dagger's made from \Nits fangs, not its bones?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.39,0:17:39.67,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That's double the attack power of Kim's sword, \Nand it has paralysis and drain effects, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.17,0:17:44.09,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This thing, on the other hand, \Nis way too scary to use.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.09,0:17:45.88,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Better to hold on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.24,0:17:56.96,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I guess I beat the dungeon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.02,0:18:10.87,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No one's around. I wonder what time it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.20,0:18:14.08,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Excuse me! You can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.59,0:18:16.66,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Didn't you hear the broadcast?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.66,0:18:17.94,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,What broadcast?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.94,0:18:20.17,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Come on, don't play around...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.69,0:18:22.89,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Wait, are you a hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:24.91,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.91,0:18:27.96,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,My apologies, then! \NLet me show you to the battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:28.96,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.96,0:18:30.34,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.67,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Did something else happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.09,0:18:42.33,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A dungeon break... I guess a magic beast \Nmade it out from a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.33,0:18:47.69,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,It's mostly taken care of, \Nbut there's one big one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.07,0:18:50.55,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Maybe it's my improved perception ability...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:55.12,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,but I can sense it. The boss is over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.42,0:19:04.50,Default,Soldier B,0,0,0,,No pictures, please! This is very dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.00,0:19:07.73,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,How much longer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.73,0:19:10.38,Default,Crowd,0,0,0,,What if things get even worse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.38,0:19:14.39,Default,Hunter A,0,0,0,,Healers, make sure to focus \Non keeping the tank healthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:16.26,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.51,0:19:20.81,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,What are our damage dealers doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.81,0:19:23.62,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,This thing doesn't look like it's going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.09,0:19:26.65,Default,Hunter D,0,0,0,,Its defense is too strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.06,0:19:29.57,Default,Hunter D,0,0,0,,And we're short on hunters who can use magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:31.48,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Excuse me! Coming through!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:34.70,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,A hastily assembled team... \NIt's no wonder they don't work together well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.51,0:19:38.08,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Low ranks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:42.47,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I see eight E-Ranks and two D-Ranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.91,0:19:46.18,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One of the D-Ranks is a tank, which is why \Nthey haven't been able to finish this,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:47.30,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,and the battle's running long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.12,0:19:51.26,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,The healers... Two D-Ranks and a B-Rank.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.29,0:19:53.63,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,Lady, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:57.55,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,You need to help someone! \NAren't you a B-Rank healer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.96,0:19:59.52,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.52,0:20:00.77,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:05.73,Default,Hunter E,0,0,0,,Seriously, stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.96,0:20:14.79,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,One week later, she's still shaken up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.28,0:20:18.37,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Not that I can blame her. I'm the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.80,0:20:21.00,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:25.57,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,This is a D-Rank boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.79,0:20:29.51,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Weaker than the one I just fought!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.89,0:20:32.82,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,We're gonna be wiped out at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.82,0:20:34.88,Default,Hunter F,0,0,0,,We can't do this without \Na higher-ranked hunter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.39,0:20:37.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,If they can get through his defenses,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:39.60,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,they can win!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.68,0:20:45.94,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,An attack forceful enough to pierce stone...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.36,DefaultItalics,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:52.63,Default,Hunter A,0,0,0,,Good! Its defenses are down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.63,0:20:53.49,Default,Hunter B,0,0,0,,We can beat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:04.82,Default,Hunter A,0,0,0,,We did it... We actually did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.10,0:21:10.47,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,None of our attacks were working. \NWhat suddenly shattered its defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.80,0:21:14.13,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,It wasn't us. We weren't \Ndoing any damage at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.80,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,What was that thing that came flying?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.77,0:21:23.27,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,A boss-level golem that over \Nten people couldn't scratch
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.27,0:21:25.28,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,got taken down by {\i0}that{\i1}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:28.24,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.24,0:21:29.30,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.30,0:21:31.77,Default,Hunter C,0,0,0,,Who threw that broken sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.77,0:21:34.19,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Oh, it was the hunter who...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.85,0:21:37.27,Default,Soldier A,0,0,0,,Huh? He was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.06,0:21:38.49,DefaultItalicsTop,Hunter C,0,0,0,,What incredible power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:41.84,DefaultItalics,Hunter C,0,0,0,,Was it some high-ranked hunter?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.98,0:21:51.20,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,I didn't think a single attack \Nwould do it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:55.02,Default,Sung Jinwoo,0,0,0,,That golem must have been \Nseriously weakened already.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.38,0:22:01.47,Default,Lee Joohee,0,0,0,,Jinwoo...?
